Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Superintelligence is arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's what Meta's AI chief
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:06.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}announced this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is he right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because if he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the biggest change
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of your lifetime
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His evidence is a single file,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}published days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.71,0:00:17.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In it, a mathematician working
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:18.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with an AI claims
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a proof of the most
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:20.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}famous unsolved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:22.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}problem in mathematics:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Riemann hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:25.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A separate program
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:26.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}checked that proof,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:27.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}step by step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:29.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its verdict: correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:31.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But written out in plain language,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:33.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it runs to over a quarter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:35.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of a million pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:37.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So far, no human
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.09,0:00:38.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fully understands it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:39.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not even the mathematician
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.93,0:00:40.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who published it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:42.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Meta's AI chief says
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it was "completed with the help
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:46.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of an alien mind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that we don't understand."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:49.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Many physicists, he writes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}would call the atomic bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a homework problem next to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If he's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this is what arrival looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.53,0:00:58.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's not arriving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.42,0:01:00.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as a machine we fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's arriving as an answer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:03.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So test his claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Five checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He doesn't pass them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The man is Alexandr Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Meta's chief AI officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:14.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He runs a lab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with the goal in its name:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:17.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Meta Superintelligence Labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That bomb comparison?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He gives no source for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:22.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And still, his essay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is no victory lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.05,0:01:25.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He calls it "lazy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.17,0:01:26.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thinking" to treat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence as inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But look at who is speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:31.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Building superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.62,0:01:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is Wang's job,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:33.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and his essay also
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:35.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}promotes his own lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:36.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Here he is, months earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}describing that project.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.55,0:01:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It looks like on the whole,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}given certainly progress
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with work you can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.59,0:01:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in front of a computer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.31,0:01:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}but also what looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it will soon happen with robotics
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.03,0:01:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and a bunch of other things,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And yet this proof
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}came from a competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we're going to have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.31,0:01:52.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}massively deflationary pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.43,0:01:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Maybe he means every word.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:55.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It also helps
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:56.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}him: if superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is arriving, his lab matters more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Both can be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So his word is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Check the claim itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}First check: is his evidence real?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:10.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What was published
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.14,0:02:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is a short note,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and about 17 million
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.83,0:02:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}lines of code.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.10,0:02:15.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No human reads that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:17.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not you, not the man who wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.93,0:02:19.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was written for a referee:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a program called Lean,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:22.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which checks every logical step
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and can't be talked into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The referee's ruling: correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Within a day, the people who
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}build that referee were convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At MIT, an independent
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}check is running.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:34.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most runs have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A few are still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:38.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}First box: gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The evidence is real,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and so far, it holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:44.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And if it keeps holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:46.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One mathematician's answer:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As you heard me say,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I don't think money's going
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to matter in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:54.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anyone will be able to have
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}any goods and services
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:55.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:57.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But a referee only rules
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the game it is given.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Check two: does the code
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.05,0:03:02.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}prove the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One critic's worry:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.35,0:03:05.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the code may prove
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a sentence that is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}true by definition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Something that sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}grand and says nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the author didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.08,0:03:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}write the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The Riemann hypothesis already
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stood in the referee's rule book,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}put there by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:19.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The people who build
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the referee reject it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:23.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The argument goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Second box: gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:26.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a question mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But whose work is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Check three: was it really the AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.57,0:03:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The proof comes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:35.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from a mathematician
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at an AI company,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}working with its AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The problem is older
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:41.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than the light bulb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The checkable proof
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:44.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}took about 6 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:45.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That company gains
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:47.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if its AI gets the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:48.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the mathematician himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He doesn't fully understand
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the proof he published.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Publishing it anyway, he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is "frankly completely
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}outrageous."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You don't say that about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your own idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Third box: gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.79,0:04:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on his own account.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Compare that with a second proof,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}claimed on the very same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So far, that one is still a claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The machine's proof
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has been checked,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and nobody can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That leaves Wang's boldest phrase:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the "alien mind".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.10,0:04:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Check four: does any
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}human understand it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On the day it appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the mathematician
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:30.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Terence Tao wrote:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"the digestion process
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will take some time."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:34.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Another mathematician
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}said it bluntly:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no one understands the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Here is Tao, in an earlier talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:42.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on proofs checked by machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}…but it will at least remove
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.56,0:04:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one of the big vectors,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:49.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which is scarcity of resources,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}including land and more materials
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}I sometimes call it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So "correct" is not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and others call it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:55.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this kind of radical abundance
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:57.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the same as understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:58.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The referee can tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}every step was legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:01.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It can't tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:02.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}why the game was won.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that gap is not a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for mathematicians alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:07.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Sooner or later it arrives
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at your table, stamped correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This box may never turn gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:13.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A quarter of a million
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}pages is more
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.76,0:05:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than one person can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:17.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}read in a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:20.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So on this point, Wang is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:22.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Something has arrived that reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:24.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}further than we can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If you pictured the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as a loud moment:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:29.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no machine announced itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:31.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A human did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What arrived was quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.49,0:05:34.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A single file.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:43.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not just for the people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:44.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:46.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.67,0:05:49.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But Wang's headline doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}say a proof is arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.13,0:05:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It says superintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So, the last check:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}does one proof mean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:06:00.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}James Maynard, a Fields medalist,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:01.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}calls the proof
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.14,0:06:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a "historic milestone",
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:03.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if it is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:06.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But for him, little changes:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he never doubted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the hypothesis was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The sharpest doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}comes from Yann LeCun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:13.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He left Meta a year ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and has called Wang
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.48,0:06:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"inexperienced".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No neutral witness, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But his objection is technical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:24.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One telltale sign of automation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:27.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is that labor's share
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.21,0:06:28.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of value added in industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:29.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The kind of AI behind
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:30.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or labor's share
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}today's chatbots, he argues,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:31.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in national income,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:32.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is a dead end
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the way to superintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the fifth box
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:38.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}only fills halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:41.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"Arriving" is a bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}placed by a man
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a stake in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the gap between correct
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:47.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and understood is no bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:48.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And behind that headline,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:52.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Wang's own essay is worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.58,0:06:53.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He finds it hard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.45,0:06:54.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to imagine humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}keeping control of something "a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.49,0:06:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thousand times smarter and more
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.55,0:06:59.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}capable than humans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:01.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in every field."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:02.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And he writes:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"We should not be okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a handover of society to AI."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:08.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A handover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What would that look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not like a coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}More like an ordinary evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:16.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a few years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.61,0:07:17.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in your town hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The old bridge, the one you cross
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}every morning, has to be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A system has designed the new one,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:25.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and marked its own design
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with one word: correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:28.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The reasoning runs
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}longer than anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.83,0:07:31.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the room could ever read.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:33.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The engineers can't follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Neither can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:35.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the system has
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}never been wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the hands go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:39.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is a handover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No robots in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nobody seizing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Just a thousand small yeses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:48.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:49.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:50.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your town's budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:52.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Each one sensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:54.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Each one a little less yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:55.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But look at what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the mathematicians actually did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:58.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They did not take
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:07:59.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine's word,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or the company's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They trusted a referee
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that humans built.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.90,0:08:05.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its rules are open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:06.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anyone can run it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Their trust moved:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}away from the answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:11.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to the check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In your town hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:15.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the system was its own referee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:16.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In mathematics, humans
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:18.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}built the referee first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So who builds the referees
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for everything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:24.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The labs could.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Wang himself writes that a better
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}future likely involves the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:29.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}industry taking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:30.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"meaningfully different
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.76,0:08:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}actions from the default path".
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He doesn't say exactly how.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:36.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One way: labs agree
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:37.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that their strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:38.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}systems hand in work
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.85,0:08:40.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a referee can check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then no answer is its own referee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The objection: whoever
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}waits falls behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So governments could
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:48.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}make it a rule
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:49.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where the stakes are high.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:50.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then your town can refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.01,0:08:53.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to vote on what nobody can check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But who checks the checkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.70,0:08:57.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Mathematics has one answer:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an open referee,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}carried by nonprofits,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.85,0:09:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not by one company.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The engineer in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:05.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}row can run it herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:06.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and nobody has to trust
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whoever sells the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The hardest objection
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:10.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is the simplest:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:12.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}results matter more
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:13.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:15.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You already cross bridges
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you could never calculate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But until now, some human could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}None of this is agreed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:23.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and none of it is tested
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:24.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at this scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:25.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who could change
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.93,0:09:28.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that: labs, governments,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}investors, and voters like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And Wang puts a clock on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"How humanity acts over
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the next year will have
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}great consequence on what
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}future world we live in."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:43.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Superintelligence is arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:45.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So, is he right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.91,0:09:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:48.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Something has arrived:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:50.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an answer that holds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so far, and that we can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:54.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Whether that is superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}remains his bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:57.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the box that is still
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:59.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}open isn't about the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.19,0:10:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So when the next
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}headline says an AI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:05.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}solved something, ask two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.59,0:10:07.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Can any human follow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:09.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And who says it's correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We may never read every answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But who gets to say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:15.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"correct" has to stay human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:18.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:18.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:20.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence goes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:21.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:23.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:24.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
